  "description": "Siho witnessed her grandfather, who cherished and raised her as a child, being murdered in front of her eyes.\n\n\"This must be a dream!\"\n\nIn front of Siho, who fainted and opened her eyes, the man who was waiting for her to wake up, says something incomprehensible whether she knows about the wedding anniversary, and points a knife at Siho.\n\nAdventure romance between brave Siho and cool crown prince Yiru! (MTL)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/55890877), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000068962), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1020012415), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12458106), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Heartskips), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/nosimjang_butluvyou), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260309)",
